  "description": "<h3><span>Description</span></h3>\n<p>The Helio two person, 3 season tent is ultralight and built-to-last. Being the most compact tent in the First Ascent range, it is specifically designed to fit in the lower compartment of a hiking pack or in a top case of an overland motorbike. Weighing only 2.45 kg, this tent is highly packable and easily transportable for couples in search of adventure. A single pole construction allows for a hassle-free and quick setup, while offering sturdy protection from adverse weather conditions. Reflective guy ropes are added for extra visibility at night. Enjoy a dry, protected and restful night's sleep in this 3 season hiking tent.</p>\n<h3 class=\"heading\">Features</h3>\n<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"std\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<ul>\n<li>Flysheet: 210T PU Polyester – Waterhead: 3000mm</li>\n<li>Inner: 68D 210T Breathable Polyester</li>\n<li>Mesh: Fine B3 mesh</li>\n<li>Door: mesh with window</li>\n<li>Floor: 150D PU Oxford Polyester - Waterhead: 5000mm</li>\n<li>Pole: 8.5mm Aluminium dual hub pole</li>\n<li>Pegs: 16mm Aluminium with reflective cord</li>\n<li>Guy ropes: Reflective ropes</li>\n<li>Includes Repair Kit</li>\n<li>Enlarged awning to store gear and shelter from wind</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading\">Specifications</h3>\n<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Weight (packed): 2.45 kg</li>\n<li>Packed Size: 39x15 cm</li>\n<li>Doors: 1</li>\n<li>Flysheet Fabric: 210T PU Polyester </li>\n<li>Floor Fabric: 150D PU Oxford Polyester</li>\n<li>Flysheet Water Column: 3000mm</li>\n<li>Floor Water Column: 5000mm</li>\n<li>Poles: 8.5mm Aluminium dual hub pole</li>\n<li>Dimensions<span>: </span>(80+210) *139/119*110cm</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
